OL,3,GNEWSAGreenway bridge plan sparks
OL,4,Afunding concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision by Wealden District Council
OL,7,F(WDC) to contribute #558,000 towards a
OL,8,Fnew bridge outside the council's
OL,9,Fboundary has been questioned.
OL,11,FHamsey Bridge would be part of a
OL,12,Fplanned nine-mile (14.5km) greenway
OL,13,Fwalking and cycle route between
OL,14,FUckfield and Lewes, using part of the
OL,15,Fformer railway track bed.
OL,17,FOpposition councillors called the
OL,18,Fdecision in for scrutiny - and members
OL,19,Fof the Wealden Line Campaign Group have
OL,20,Fsaid the planned route would end their
OL,21,Fhopes of the railway line between Lewes
OL,22,Fand Tunbridge Wells returning.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
