OL,3,GNEWSAGreenway bridge plan sparks
OL,4,Afunding concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FWDC said the bridge over the River Ouse
OL,7,Fwas "essential infrastructure" that
OL,8,Fwould unlock wider benefits for Wealden
OL,9,Fas well as Lewes, and releasing funds
OL,10,Fwould be conditional.
